{"server":"jp","storyId":"main_4_level_main_04-09_end","groupId":"main_4","stageId":"main_04-09","title":"骨の髄まで","storyCode":"4-9","avgTag":"戦闘後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/jp/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_04-09_end.txt","sourceHash":"c542e34464ee00f6de5d755887bf19c31025434fd3fa9cfb144eb32bb24a1958","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"フロストリーフはメフィストに向かって突撃し、そばまで距離を詰めていく。あと少しでメフィストを捉えようかというその時、空気が急変した。\nスノーデビルの増援と、その中心人物であるフロストノヴァの登場により、一行は絶体絶命となり、フロストリーフは皆を逃がすべく身を挺するのだった。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第三十二关（前）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メテオリーテ","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"フロストリーフ、そんなに突出しないで！　危ないでしょう！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フロストリーフ","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"無茶は承知の上だ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"うわあああっ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"れ、冷気で盾を裂かれた……！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"そんなこと、あるのか……！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フロストリーフ","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"邪魔だ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メテオリーテ","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"アーミヤ！　フロストリーフが敵陣に突っ込んで、あの指揮官のほうへ向かってるわ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"――！　狙撃オペレーターと術師オペレーターで、フロストリーフさんの援護をお願いします！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メフィスト","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"おやおや？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メフィスト","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"どうして僕のところへ来たのかな？　子ギツネさん。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フロストリーフ","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"貴様に罪を贖わせ、苦痛の涙を流させて――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フロストリーフ","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"――命を奪ってやるためだ。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"退いてください！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"うわあっ！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"な、なんだこの黒いアーツ……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"っ、撤退だ！　走れ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"メフィストの手下みたいにはなりたかねーからな……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"もう逃げ場はありませんよ、メフィスト！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メフィスト","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"おっと。今の人員じゃ、ロドスの相手にはならないか。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"あなたの残酷な行いを、悔い改めてもらいます！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フロストリーフ","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"さあ、観念しろ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メフィスト","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"子ギツネさん、少し近すぎやしないかい？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フロストリーフ","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"この手で貴様を殺すためだからな。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フロストリーフ","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"命を冒涜する者に――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フロストリーフ","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"生きる価値などない。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メフィスト","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"ふうん。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_6"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メフィスト","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"まあ、好きなように言えばいいさ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フロストリーフ","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"……！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フロストリーフ","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"なっ、脚が……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メテオリーテ","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"アーミヤ！　そこら中からレユニオンが……！　数こそ多くはないけれど、これは……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メテオリーテ","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"……っ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メテオリーテ","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"あれは……スノーデビル小隊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メテオリーテ","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"あの人たちまでお出ましとはね……！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メフィスト","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"さて、君たちに新しいお友達を紹介してあげよう。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メフィスト","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"この舞台での真の主役をどうか拍手で迎えておくれ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メフィスト","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"西北凍原の悪夢と呼ばれた、スノーデビルのお姫様――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メフィスト","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"フロストノヴァだ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メフィスト","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"彼女にかかれば、君たちの血も肉もすべてが凍り付いて――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メフィスト","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"少しずつ、少しずつ、削り取られていくことになる。まあ、大いに楽しんでくれ。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……っ！　ダメ……！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_40_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フロストノヴァ","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"――――"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_40_2"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_light"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フロストノヴァ","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"――――――メフィスト。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フロストノヴァ","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"まずは、獣よりよほど残酷な殺人鬼であるお前から、雪原に放り出して殺すべきだと思うがな。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_6"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メフィスト","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"へえ、言ってくれるじゃないか。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メフィスト","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"だけど、今回の敵はロドスでしょう？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_6"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"フロストリーフさん――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"下がってください。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フロストリーフ","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フロストリーフ","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"アーミヤ、皆を連れて逃げろ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"できません！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"あんな人が相手では……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フロストリーフ","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"そうだな。……奴に追いつかれてしまったら――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フロストリーフ","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"私たちに勝ち目はない。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フロストリーフ","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"……ふっ。……まだ、十分に生きたとは言えないが……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フロストリーフ","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"お前たちに出会えて、私は幸せだった。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フロストリーフ","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"――行け。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"フロストリーフさん！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フロストリーフ","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"いいから走れ！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_40_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フロストノヴァ","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"――――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フロストノヴァ","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"案ずるな、ロドスの者たちよ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フロストノヴァ","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"お前たちのことは、苦しまないよう死なせてやろう。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["アーミヤ"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["レユニオン構成員"]},{"speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","aliases":["フロストノヴァ"]},{"speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","aliases":["メフィスト"]},{"speakerId":"char_193_frostl","aliases":["フロストリーフ"]},{"speakerId":"char_219_meteo","aliases":["メテオリーテ"]}]}
